                <rule id="r64-if-dorn-huscarl-r64-if-huscarl-retinue" name="Retinue" hidden="false">
                  <description>One Huscarl Terminator Retinue may be selected for Rogal Dorn, Sigismund or an Imperial Fists Praetor wearing Terminator Armour. The squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.</description>
